---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Editorial Policy & Ethics — tiwantiwa" 
  description="Our commitment to editorial independence, accuracy, sourcing standards, and human editorial oversight."
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="space-y-6 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-serif font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Editorial Policy & Ethics
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-serif italic">
         Rigorous journalism backed by transparent technology and strict human oversight.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-amber max-w-none font-serif text-lg leading-relaxed text-zinc-300 space-y-6">
      <p>
        At <strong>tiwantiwa</strong>, we believe that the future of independent media relies on a seamless synthesis of high-speed data intelligence and rigorous human editorial governance.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Human-in-the-Loop Governance</h2>
      <p>
        While our autonomous intelligence engines scan global feeds, analyze trends, and draft preliminary dispatches, <strong>no article goes live without explicit human verification</strong>. Every piece of published content sits in a secure staging queue and undergoes final review, fact-checking, and sign-off by our editorial leadership.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Accuracy and Transparency</h2>
      <p>
        We are committed to factual accuracy, primary-source attribution, and transparent reporting. When economic data, market indices, or policy shifts are cited, we link directly to verified sources or primary institutional data.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Independence and Integrity</h2>
      <p>
        Our coverage of business, technology, startups, and diaspora investment is entirely independent. Sponsored or affiliate content is strictly demarcated, ensuring our readership receives unbiased analysis.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 font-semibold transition-colors">
        &larr; Back to Feed
      </a>
      <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500 font-sans">
        tiwantiwa.com Standards
      </span>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
